    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐλᾰμ-ός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throng of warriors</i>, esp. in
			battle, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ. ἀνδρῶν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.251
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				273
			</span></i>, al. (never in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελισσαῖος οὐ</span>. <i>a
				swarm</i> of bees, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				611
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later as a
			t.t., <i>troop</i> of cavalry, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.28.3
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
